flowchart TD
  task[Delegated task] --> q{What is the bottleneck?}
  q -->|ordinary or no custom route| sub[subagent or subagent_fork<br/>inherits the session model]
  q -->|difficulty with a custom route| pro[subagent_pro<br/>custom endpoint/model from Settings<br/>else session model]
  q -->|must see an image| vision[subagent_vision<br/>custom endpoint/model from Settings<br/>else session model]

  sub --> routine[Review, lookup, validation,<br/>literature search]
  sub --> hard[Proof or derivation<br/>causal-inference critique<br/>subtle methodological flaw<br/>large multi-file refactor]
  pro --> custom[The same difficulty-bound work<br/>on the configured route]
  vision --> image[read_image in the child<br/>plot, figure, scan, PDF page]
  image --> render[PDF pages rendered first<br/>pdftoppm -png -r 150]

  classDef route fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef model fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef use fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#0f172a
  class q route
  class sub,pro,vision model
  class routine,hard,custom,image,render,task use
